          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Every year, 1st – 7th June is Volunteers Week. This is when we celebrate the invaluable contribution of our volunteers."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Our services depend on the commitment and dedication of volunteers and has done since our founding in 1884. We want to thank all of our volunteers past and present for their vital contributions and for their kind, caring attitude which makes such a difference to our clients."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "We asked some of our volunteers about the impact volunteering has had on them and spoke to some of our staff about the importance of volunteers."
        },
